  introDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 212d303125ea9c240a5729652639a37a, type: 2}
  questionResponses:
  - question: Where are you coming from?
    earlyDaysAnswer: The apiary. East side. I cleaned frames. The bees were... quiet. Good day.
    midDaysAnswer: The apiary. The hives are... wrong. The site closed. So... only the bees now.
    finalDaysAnswer: The hives. I went to... say goodbye. The master was not there.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: The honey cooperative. West district. I am... the master there. I run the hives.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: The apiary. Master Tengiz sent me home early. He said... rest.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Home. My mother's flat. I have always... lived with her. It is quiet.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  - question: Are you experiencing any symptoms?
    earlyDaysAnswer: My chest is... tight. Dust from the site. The foreman says so.
    midDaysAnswer: My head is heavy. Like it is full of... honey. And I cough. Something dark.
    finalDaysAnswer: I do not sleep. When I do... I wake up wet. My ears ring.
    mismatchEarlyDaysAnswer: No. My chest is... clear. I do not work at any site. Only the bees.
    mismatchMidDaysAnswer: My head is... light. Very clear. I have not needed... any doctor.
    mismatchFinalDaysAnswer: Nothing. I am... forty now. The body... settles at forty.
    uncannyEarlyDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyMidDaysAnswer: 
    uncannyFinalDaysAnswer: 
    cameraTrigger: 
  idleBarks:
    earlyDays:
    - The bees are... very restless today. More than usual.
    - You smell... not like smoke. That is... unusual. In a good way.
    - I counted the steps from the apiary to here. It is always the same number. Mostly.
    midDays:
    - There is a buzzing in this booth. Can you hear it? It is... lower than bees.
    - The air tastes different today. Like... burnt sugar. You do not taste it?
    - My head is... heavier lately. I think it is filling with something.
    finalDays:
    - The queen is very close now. I can feel her. Through the walls.
    - You do not need to worry about me. I am... being taken care of.
    - The swarm is coming. Not here. Somewhere better.
    uncannyEarlyDays: []
    uncannyMidDays: []
    uncannyFinalDays: []
